Error: Jet.ValueTypeMismatch: Decimal (an exact base-10 number) can't use `:Fixed(n)`
  --> Tests/UI/fixed_interpolation_non_float.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     print("{count:Fixed(2)}")
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: `:Fixed(n)` calls `fixed` of `FixedFormat`, which Decimal doesn't implement
 Fix: Use bare interpolation for this value, or convert it to a type that implements `FixedFormat`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ValueTypeMismatch
